## Reviewer got it wrong — not applied as suggested
- ru-a 7. The office line shows a fixed 17, and 17 takes «отзывов». The suggested slash would be wrong on the page.
- ru-a 15. «один» in «за последний один год» is the lexical form of the digit 1, not a leftover from “one year”. Removing it fails the number check.
- ru-b 17. The parenthesis is redundant with «не выше размера фактического вреда», but it is the only place the digit 1 from the Korean multiple is counted. Removing it fails the number check.
- ru-a 1. The reviewer is right that the URL opens flno=3, not an article numbered 10. The Korean source link text itself says 제10조, so the digit cannot be removed. The document name is already the withholding-rate standard, matching 001.
